<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Sustain</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 3), Healer (guild level 6), Paladin (guild level 18), Druid (guild level 22)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast sustain &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast sustain</a>   (on yourself)
</pre>
<p>Holds the target's hunger and thirst where they are when the spell is cast. 
While it lasts, they get no hungrier and no thirstier, but eating or drinking 
does nothing either: it all comes back to where it was. The same goes for 
being drunk.
</p><p>So eat and drink your fill first, then cast it: you stay full for as long as 
it lasts. The better your protection sphere, the longer that is, from a minute 
up to several minutes. On someone already sustained, it does nothing.
</p><p>You must be standing, not fighting. It is also found on scrolls, potions and 
staffs.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Eat</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Drink</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Protection Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>